<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sometimes I think that I might leave</l><l>And wallow in misery,</l><l>But then graciously He comes</l><l>And applies His gentle, soothing touch.</l><l>’Tis my story and my fight;</l><l>To the self I say goodbye;</l><l>I now walk and live in light</l><l>With the coming kingdom full in sight.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
